         {"key": "uk-web-host-review",
"title": "<b>UK Web Host Review</b>: ",
"data":{
   "shortURL": "/uk-web-host-review",
   "creationTime": "1508758198.39",
   "title": "UK Web Host Review",
   "class": "CompanyGroup",
   "source": ""<p>My name is James, and I&rsquo;m the editor and owner of UK Web Host Review.</p>\n\n<p>I&rsquo;ve been developing websites for a living for the&nbsp;<em>past 15 years now</em>, and in that time I&rsquo;ve had the opportunity to use&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.ukwebhostreview.com/cheap-web-hosting\">many different hosting companies</a>, many of which failed to live up to their sales hype..which led me to starting a site solely for the purpose of testing and evaluating different hosting companies. I once owned a digital agency which gave me a vast overview of different hosting solutions along with feedback from my clients. It turns out that&nbsp;<em>most&nbsp;</em>providers don&rsquo;t provide the performance or up-time that your site should have.</p>\n\n<p><em><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.ukwebhostreview.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/rsz_me.png\" style=\"float:right; height:auto; margin:7px 0px 7px 24px; width:161px\" />We constantly monitor and evaluate&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.ukwebhostreview.com/\">each hosting company</a>&nbsp;and provide relevant up-time statistics to give you a clear and concise overview.</em></p>\n\n<p>To put it simply I have signed up and reviewed each host based on performance data such as response times and customer service waiting times. Simple metrics I know but are often over looked.&nbsp;I have spent countless hours going through each service with the proverbial fine tooth comb so that I can provide you with a fair and thorough insight into what it&rsquo;s really like to&nbsp;host your website with these brands.</p>\n"",
   "lattitude": "51.5306325",
   "longitude": "-0.0935696",
   "description": "Hosting Reviews",
   "branchSize": "1",
   "location": "london"},
"a_attr": {"href": "/uk-web-host-review"}},
